                <pb facs="0786" n="684" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg684"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.003/6: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate
                            Peace to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-03-01T11:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 1, 1919,
                                11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 1,
                            11.15 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>977. Your 888, February 26, 7 p.m. I doubt the advisability of going to the
                    expense of maintaining at the Legation an unasked for adviser to the Chinese
                    Government. Lansing.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi>[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >erican</hi>] <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mission</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
